# Valgrind memcheck suppressions for the kaban-vtab tests (docs/developer/SAFETY.md, memory
# checker). Matching needs the symbol table: do not strip the test binaries.

# A contained panic's payload is leaked, never dropped: its destructor could panic again
# (src/adapter.rs `contain`, src/allocator.rs).
{
   kaban-vtab-contained-panic-payload
   Memcheck:Leak
   match-leak-kinds: definite
   fun:malloc
   ...
   fun:*__rust_start_panic*
}
